# Source: Fossati, Mellan, Kuganathan, Lee, J. Am. Ceram. Soc. 104, 1331-1344 (2021), https://doi.org/10.1111/jace.17549, VDOS figure, panel (A).
# Digitized from the published figure by pixel colour; panel offsets removed. Accuracy about +-0.3 in DOS and +-0.5 meV in energy.
# Silica glass VDOS from MD with the Pedone and SHIK potentials. Curves: median pixel row of the curve colour per
# image column, resampled to 0.5 meV. Pedone: 8 bins below 20 meV hidden under markers replaced by linear
# interpolation; SHIK: 9 empty bins interpolated. Both integrate to 1 over energy.
